			(property "Description" "Good Display 2.13in 250x122 monochrome e-paper (SSD1680-class), 24-pin 0.5 mm FPC with the same pin positions as the Pervasive iTC panels. Footprint is the Hirose FH34SRJ-24S-0.5SH socket (LCSC C324726); see E2206KS0E1 for FPC orientation. BUSY is active HIGH. TSCL/TSDA (optional external temperature sensor) and VPP (test) may be left open. Booster per GD datasheet section 12: 47 uH, Si1308EDL-class N-FET on GDR with 1 M pulldown, 2.2 R sense on RESE, 3x MBR0530, 1 uF/25 V on VSH2/VDD/VSH1/VSL/VCOM and the PREVGH/PREVGL (VGH/VGL) nodes. For the tail folded under the panel, use GDEY0213B74_FoldedUnder."
				(at 0 0 0)
